<title>USA: Alamo Group says to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Alamo Group says to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>SEGUIN, Texas 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alamo Group Inc said Wednesday its directors authorized the repurchase of up to 1,000,000 shares of the company's outstanding common stock, or apprroximately 10 percent of Alamo's 9,700,000 common shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The company said any purchases will be made periodically in the open market.</p>
<p>They will be funded through working capital and borrowings under Alamo's bank revolving credit facility and will have no effect on any current or future expansion plans, the company said.</p>
</text>
